# SPA deep-link fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Every deep route in this TanStack Router app lives under /c/ (e.g.
# /c/024/moves/301). Rewrite those to the site root so a direct load /
# refresh / shared link serves index.html and the client router takes
# over. Real files (/assets/*, /data/*) are served before _redirects.
#
# The destination is "/" (NOT "/index.html"): Cloudflare's _redirects
# validator (error 10021) rejects any rule whose destination is a path
# it would clean-URL-strip — "/index.html" strips ".html" and "/index",
# which trips the loop check. "/" is already canonical (nothing to
# strip), so this rule passes. Add a line here for any non-/c/ route.
/c/*  /  200
